    "<video class=\"pageVideo\" id=\"pageVideo\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"\">\n<source src=\"http://kwang37.witches.kr/n_dong2.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<br><br>\n<video class=\"pageVideo\" id=\"pageVideo\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"\">\n<source src=\"http://kwang37.witches.kr/n_dong2-2.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<p>문화예술협동조합 아트컴퍼니길의&nbsp; 공연 영상입니다.</p><p>&nbsp;(9월8일 청운공원)</p>": 1,
